  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation with Research Council - Ongoing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this cooperation was to support welfare and augment economic development in India by facilitating collaboration between some of the world&#x2019;s best research and education institutions in Norway and India and generating scientific knowledge.
Opportunity in Diversity, the Norwegian Government Strategy for cooperation between Norway and India (2009) underlined the importance of research for achieving political, economic and societal objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
